2026-07-27T07:54:01.4891380Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T07:54:01.4964918Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:54:01.4965566Z i /tmp/RtmpEly53P/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:54:01.4966000Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:54:01.4966881Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:54:01.4967778Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:54:01.4968480Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:54:01.4969549Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:54:01.4970324Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:54:01.5223964Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:54:01.5335425Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:54:01.5811961Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:54:01.6004948Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
